1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,122
They call it just one percent. Over
forty years it's three hundred sixteen
grand.

2
00:00:04,422 --> 00:00:07,894
Two identical funds. One charges one
percent more a year.

3
00:00:08,694 --> 00:00:12,634
Five hundred a month, forty years,
seven percent before fees.
Hypothetical.

4
00:00:12,934 --> 00:00:16,132
Ten years in, the gap's forty-six
hundred. Nobody cares.

5
00:00:16,982 --> 00:00:20,267
Forty years in? Three hundred sixteen
thousand dollars. Gone.

6
00:00:21,167 --> 00:00:23,945
That's more than the two hundred forty
grand you even put in.

7
00:00:24,845 --> 00:00:27,866
Would you even notice a one percent
fee? Be honest. Comment.

8
00:00:28,229 --> 00:00:28,954
Follow.
